  "instructions": [
    "Rinse the toor dal and soak it in water for 30 minutes.",
    "Drain and boil the toor dal in 4 cups of water until it is tender.",
    "In a large pan, heat the ghee over medium heat.",
    "Add the onion, garlic, and ginger to the pan and saute until the onion is translucent.",
    "Add the rest-meat to the pan and cook until it is browned.",
    "Add the cumin, coriander, turmeric, and salt to the pan and stir well.",
    "Add the cooked toor dal to the pan and stir well.",
    "Reduce heat to low and simmer the mixture for 10 minutes.",
    "Serve the Oily Saudi Arabian Toor Dal hot."
